vocabulary <https://kotoba.local/core#> as core {
 extends <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> as xsd
 aspect Entity [ key id key identityKey ] < [ restricts id to exactly 1 restricts identityKey to exactly 1 restricts revision to exactly 1 restricts createdAt to exactly 1 restricts updatedAt to exactly 1 ]
 scalar property id [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property identityKey [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property revision [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property createdAt [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property updatedAt [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar TextState [ oneOf "new", "completed" ]
 scalar Area [ oneOf "reading", "listening" ]
 scalar Progress [ oneOf "new", "learning", "familiar", "known" ]
 scalar JobState [ oneOf "pending", "running", "ready", "failed" ]
 scalar property name [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property title [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property body [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property textState [ domain Entity range TextState functional ]
 scalar property cursor [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property archived [ domain Entity range xsd:boolean functional ]
 scalar property ordinal [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property start [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property end [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property surface [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property reading [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property meaning [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property partOfSpeech [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property family [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property area [ domain Entity range Area functional ]
 scalar property state [ domain Entity range Progress functional ]
 scalar property evidence [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property day [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property kind [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property amount [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property details [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property url [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property sourceKey [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property sourceType [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property pronunciation [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property voice [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property speed [ domain Entity range xsd:decimal functional ]
 scalar property engine [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property asset [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property jobState [ domain Entity range JobState functional ]
 scalar property payload [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property result [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property error [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property lease [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property attempts [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
 scalar property actor [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property action [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property digest [ domain Entity range xsd:string functional ]
 scalar property version [ domain Entity range xsd:integer functional ]
}
